@startuml agentic-value-stream-measurement-anti-patterns
' Per CR-VAS-005 §30 (Measurement Anti-Patterns).
' Cardinal author rule: Emmanuel A. Otchere <emmanuel@otchere.com>
' Last revised: 2026-10-08.

title Agentic Value Stream ; Measurement Anti-Patterns

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam shadowing false

card "AP-1\nAgent Count = Value" as AP1 #LightPink
card "AP-2\nAutonomy = Performance" as AP2 #LightPink
card "AP-3\nAutomation Rate = Agenticity" as AP3 #LightPink
card "AP-4\nDecision Volume = Effectiveness" as AP4 #LightPink
card "AP-5\nLess Intervention = Better AVS" as AP5 #LightPink
card "AP-6\nAI Model Quality = Value" as AP6 #LightPink
card "AP-7\nCost Reduction = Sole Value" as AP7 #LightPink

AP1 --> [False]
AP2 --> [False]
AP3 --> [False]
AP4 --> [False]
AP5 --> [False]
AP6 --> [False]
AP7 --> [False]

note bottom of AP1
  Each anti-pattern represents a way
  measurement can become a backdoor
  definition of agenticity.

  Per CR-VAS-005 §30 + AC-26.
end note

@enduml
